    ('IborRangeAccrualLeg:Black:CallSpreadCouponPricer', ores_utility_system_tenant_id_fn(), 0, 'Black', 'CallSpreadCouponPricer', 'IborRangeAccrualLeg', false, 'Builds a RangeAccrualPricerByCallSpread for the range accrual leg. The pricer uses the optionlet (capFloor) volatility surface directly and prices each daily range observation as a call-spread on vanilla caplet/floorlet prices: textDigital(K) approx fracC(K - varepsilon/2,, sigma_K-varepsilon/2) - C(K + varepsilon/2,, sigma_K+varepsilon/2)varepsilon This is the same model-free replication approach used by the RateDigitalOption trade type. It supports both Black (shifted-lognormal) and Bachelier (normal) optionlet volatility surfaces natively, without conversion.', 'ores_analytics_service', 'system.initial_load', 'Seed pricing engine vocabulary'),
